    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Access Values from an Array\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use your `favoritesArray` from the previous level.\r\n\r\n2. Prompt AI to write code that displays the first three items from your array. on the page.\r\n\r\n3. Review the code AI gives you and make sure it uses:\r\n   * `favoritesArray[0]`\r\n   * `favoritesArray[1]`\r\n   * `favoritesArray[2]`\r\n\r\n4. Run your code and check your results:\r\n   * Do the items match what you expected?\r\n   * What do you notice about the index numbers?\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
